        "preference_table.title": "Preference Table",
        "summary": "<xdoc><p>Identifies overlapping Air Traffic Service (ATS) routes and calculates fields in the Target Cartographic Route Features to aid in cartographic display.</p><p>Using Process ATS Route preferences, this tool allows you to identify overlapping ATS routes on a chart. Once overlapping ATS routes have been identified, the tool uses the provided Process ATS Route preferences to generalize or offset the routes.</p></xdoc>",
